WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.840
In the near future, Doc Terror and his cyborg companion, Hacker,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.440
unleash their forces to conquer Earth.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.130
Only one force can stop this evil, a handful of brave men.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:17.330
In specially created exo-frames, they can be transported anywhere

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.440
to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.980
beam down from the space station Sky Vault,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:29.330
becoming man and machine power extreme.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.360
Max Ray, brilliant sea operations commander.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.200
Jake Rockwell, rugged land operations specialist.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.740
Ace McLeod, daring air operations expert.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.070
Whatever the challenge, they are ready.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:55.930
The Centurions!

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:10.060
Previously, we saw Docterror create the Neutron Vortex, a potentially devastating force.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.900
Aboard Sky Vault, the Centurions quickly detected the danger.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:21.540
They devise a plan for John Thunder to infiltrate Docterror's secret fortress, Dominion.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.500
There, he met and did battle with Claw, an adversary from his past,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:48.940
while Doc Terror lost control of the awesome force he created.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.740
Check this radioactive.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.420
We must stop it! It should destroy the minion pistol!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.960
Looks like Max was right, Lucy. Reality is breaking down.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.270
Tentorian Sea to Sky Vault. Still no sign of anything.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:01.340
Thank you.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:33.470
These force bubbles will protect us from the radiation!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:45.180
There it is, and you sent your magnet to repel!

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.380
Not a threat!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.820
It's after me, dog!

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:51.360
Help!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.140
Centurion night log entry.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.280
Still haven't found a way to get Dominion's location coordinates to Sky Vault.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:14.650
Keep looking.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:23.090
Computer, beam detonator to Jake, orbital interceptor to Ace, S to Max.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.640
Power screen.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:41.060
i'm beaming you back to sky vault before anything else happens

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:55.150
powerful than ever now thunder will finish this for good

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.740
Inexplicable phenomena are happening.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:04.380
No doubt is a result of Terra's experiments.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.880
Claw is still alive and still looking for me.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.200
I can sense it.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:15.550
Only there was some way I could reach the man he once was.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.890
The man I called Friend.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:50.180
Remember, my son, he who overcome others is strong, but he who overcome himself is mighty.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:28.110
thunder calling sky vault i read you john barely coordinates

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.090
Dominion, under here.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:35.530
Guys, I'm getting coordinates for Dominion,

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.700
but they don't make any sense.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.660
It must be due to the space-time distortion.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.440
We have to take the chance that they might be wrong.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.500
But you could wind up inside solid rock.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.660
Do it. There's no other way.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.870
Good luck, Centurions.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:15.000
I'm Sky Vault. We can't get through.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:18.900
Let's hope Crystal can send our weapon systems to the same coordinates.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.950
No use, Lucy. These coordinates no longer work.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.480
Looks like the phone is out for now.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:38.620
I hope the others made it.

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:40.490
Under!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.900
You are the best of all my students.

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:55.400
The inner strings, the key, is very strong within you both.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:59.690
But one of you has a flaw, if not overcome.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.620
It will destroy you.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:25.990
But you did not see if your key would match John's.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.720
Instead, you sought to win with a kick.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:45.960
so doing you lost you humiliated me i thought you were my friend is here john have you forgotten

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:53.480
sensei's lessons claw external power cannot overcome inner strength we'll find out if your

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.840
key is a match for my cyborg bionics

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.000
Blast.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.430
Another time, John.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.450
Coordinates again.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.080
Computer, prepare for beam link.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:26.700
Acknowledged.

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:28.460
Attention, centurions.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:29.920
A window in the...

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:33.450
Amelie Field has opened. Stand by for Assault Weapon Systems.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:36.820
This is like something out of a horror movie.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.260
Must be where terror stores his genetic experiments.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.240
Turian Systems.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.140
Good old Crystal. She got through.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:55.630
Let's hope the weapon systems get through.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:56.670
We're gonna need them.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.660
Uh-oh.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:01.550
It's time to blow a fuse.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.030
Extreme.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.180
Our X-3!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.420
This cat is toast!

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:27.980
Glowing means what I think it means.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:28.920
It's bad!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:29.760
Quick!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:37.220
emergency jettison procedure they don't build them like they used to do they

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:48.300
it's an 80 what's causing it we think it has something to do with the altered

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:53.170
reality states terror has created i hate to interrupt this discussion but we

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.130
better move fast

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:17.540
I thought I heard Jake blowing up the countryside.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:19.060
Centurion!

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.440
Get ready to move!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:41.140
Terra's experiment is out of control. We've got to stop it before the planet is destroyed.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:51.780
Hold the Magnaster works better in extreme cold. That's why I drove the Vortex in here.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.740
I don't think it likes the cold, Doc.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.810
Get ready.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.500
He's heading for the power reactor.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.490
Let's hope that window's still open.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.440
John Thunder to Sky Vault.

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.570
John, you're all right.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.180
We're gonna need the heavy artillery, Chris.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.260
Configure Jake's Hornet detonator combination for me.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:29.970
And...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.380
Put an anti-magnetic shield around the systems.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:33.820
Copy, Max.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.280
That should stabilize them.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.120
Fire Force Wild Weasel for Jake,

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.670
Orbital Interceptor Skybolt for Ace,

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.410
and Gatlingard for Rex.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.220
Leaving the party when it's getting good, John?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.630
I have unfinished business.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.360
Repair for Beam Link.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.410
Ow!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:42.890
Somebody make us something quick till the last minute.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.310
Have you no sense of drama?

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.160
I'm reading some dangerous power fluctuations.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.100
The anomaly must be affecting the power supply.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.600
This place could go up like Krakatoa unless we stop it.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.200
Lead the way, Rex.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:07.040
This is the last time, John.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:09.810
Yes.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.820
It's too strong. We can't contain it.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.020
This can't be happening.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.470
When you alter the structure of reality, anything can happen.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.740
I think it's time we moved up in the world.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.180
Business room.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:16.600
It's a combat training chamber, John.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:21.420
Maybe not, but you've already lost, Claw.

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:27.860
I didn't get my chances on the ceiling falling this time, Max.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.620
I think you're right, Jake.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:49.660
It's called partner. You brought the house down. Come on. We still got to find the reactor

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.250
It appears that fate has decided once again, John.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:36.900
Crystal, you still with us?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.540
Just barely, Max.

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:41.850
And it's getting worse as you get closer to the anomaly.

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.650
Stay back. The radiation will cook you.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:04.540
What's up? I'm Nero. I see the sump.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.460
Only one chance.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.760
Channel the energy into magnetic implosion.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.840
Oh, he's just going to prove.

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.610
Crystal, get us out of here.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:52.940
Reality seems to be back to normal, whatever that is.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:56.100
The coordinates for Dominion are useless, I'm afraid.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.300
They only worked in the altered continuum.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:19:59.720
Doesn't matter.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.920
Nothing could have lived through that.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.360
That's the end of Doctora.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:07.820
Maybe, but we've said that before.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:09.750
Did you find him, John?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:12.520
Yes, I found him.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.260
Well, did you win?

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.950
No, nobody won.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:29.780
Today.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.500
Today, oceans separate the continents, but once, they were all joined together.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:40.050
About 300 million years ago, only one giant landmass, called Pangea, rose out of the ocean.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:45.290
Under the Earth's crust, there is a soft layer, which may be composed of molten rock, like

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:45.630
lava.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:49.170
It varies from 3 to 25 miles below the surface.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:53.660
Sections of the crust moved slowly apart, riding on this soft layer.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:56.180
The ocean filled the spaces between them.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.970
This is where they are today, and we have no reason to...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:08.160
believe that they will stop but don't pack your suitcases for the trip they only move a few inches

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:08.780
each year

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:32.920
Thank you.
